#HELPS
1 DAGON FEL~
Dagon Fel is Vvardenfell's northernmost settlement, set on windswept Sheogorad
where Nord fishermen share a remote harbor under the watch of Imperial guards.
Simple homes, a tiny inn and traders cluster near three ancient Dwemer towers,
while cold seas batter the rocky shore beyond the village.~
